              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "If your Navara D40 YD25 rattles on cold start, get it inspected immediately. Preventative chain replacement costs £800-£1,500. Ignoring it could cost £4,000-£5,000 for a reconditioned engine — or £10,000+ at a dealer."
